WEBVTT

00:01:38.663 --> 00:01:44.329
Now, Mr. President, 
let’s take a deep breath, shall we?

00:01:45.079 --> 00:01:49.496
It’s a big leap—or, one might say, 
a long slide—

00:01:49.496 --> 00:01:52.204
from communist governance of Vietnam

00:01:52.204 --> 00:01:56.079
to the global spread of authoritarian
communist regimes.

00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:59.829
It’s as if we were to say 
you were clothed,

00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:01.621
now you’re in your underwear,